On identifie le double
--> This is a Vector of <double>
On identifie le int
--> This is a Vector of <Id>
Array of Double: Initial vector of Double
[0 1 2 1.234e+30 4 5 6 7 8 9]
Array of Double: After adding this to itself
[0 2 4 1.234e+30 8 10 12 14 16 18]
Array of Double: After adding a constant to this
[12 14 16 1.234e+30 20 22 24 26 28 30]
Array of Id: Initial Vector of Id
[0 1 2 -1234567 4 5 6 7 8 9]
Array of Id: After adding this to itself
[0 2 4 -1234567 8 10 12 14 16 18]
Array of Id: After adding a constant to this
[12 14 16 -1234567 20 22 24 26 28 30]
